msgctxt "216"
msgid "Oh, hey there... You finally made it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Yeah, I thought I'd come check things out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Oh, and I ran into that Yonashiro-san you told me about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"Yonashiro-san's a pretty tough opponent, huh? He can use all sorts of "
"weapons, like nunchaku and whatnot. You could really learn a lot from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"I bet. I just didn't like how he showed up at my house all of the sudden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "What!? Was that a problem...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "No, he's a great teacher. Thanks for sending him my way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Anyway, Yonashiro-san told me to bring the Certificates over to your place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Oh, right, the Master Certificates. See, I only mod weapons for people who "
"have them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"Because Yonashiro-san said so. He got really pissed at me one time and said,"
" \"Don't you go selling weapons to just any fool off the street.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Frankly, I think I should be able to sell to anyone I want, but he really "
"scares me. Can't figure the guy out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Oh, hey there... You finally made it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"At this shop, I sell weapons I've made and replenish ammo. I also have a "
"weapon-modding service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Modding? What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Well, it's a way to upgrade your weapons. I call it modding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"To mod a weapon, you need a design, a weapon to serve as the starting point,"
" and some materials. I can mod gear and accessories, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Oh, I almost forgot... Did I tell you how my shop works?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "You can modify your weapons, gear, and accessories here."
msgstr "Qui puoi modificare le tue armi, equipaggiamento e accessori."

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"Start by getting all the required items.\r\n"
"Then, make a selection on the Mod menu to modify equipped items.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"You will need a <Color:255,255,0,255>design from a book or DVD<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"a <Color:255,255,0,255>weapon or piece of equipment<Color:Default> to  mod,\r\n"
"<Color:255,255,0,255>materials<Color:Default> with which to complete the mod,\r\n"
"and the <Color:255,255,0,255>funds<Color:Default> to cover Kamiyama's costs."
msgstr ""
"Inizia recuperando tutti gli oggetti necessari. Poi, scegli dal menu "
"Modifica cosa vuoi potenziare tra gli oggetti equipaggiati. Ti serviranno "
"uno <Color:255,255,0,255>schema da un libro o un DVD<Color:Default>, "
"un'<Color:255,255,0,255>arma o un pezzo d'equipaggiamento<Color:Default> da "
"potenziare, i <Color:255,255,0,255>materiali<Color:Default> per completare "
"il potenziamento, e i <Color:255,255,0,255>fondi<Color:Default> per coprire "
"i costi di Kamiyama."

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Check the required weapons and materials by displaying the Pause Menu and "
"then going to \"Designs\" under \"Valuables\" in the Items screen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"In addition to modding, I also make my own equipment. I'll show it to you, "
"if you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Oh, hey there. What can I do for you today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "All right, then. Maybe next time."
msgstr "D'accordo, allora. Magari la prossima volta."

